Write pinned-then-newest titles into a managed CLAUDE.md / AGENTS.md block

Usage: rtok memory sync [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --config <PATH>    User config file (else `RTOK_CONFIG` or `<home>/config.toml`)
      --file <FILE>      CLAUDE.md or AGENTS.md [default: CLAUDE.md]
      --budget <BUDGET>  Token budget; default `[plugins.memory] sync_tokens`
      --dry-run          Print the unified diff and write nothing
      --stat             With --dry-run: stat lines and totals instead of the diff
      --remove           Delete the managed block and nothing else
      --force            Overwrite a hand-edited block
  -h, --help             Print help
